    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The most epic race of all time is about to start.</h2>You have been selected as one of the drivers representing Earth. <br>It\u2019s a race of life and death as only the fastest will survive. <br>Do you have what it takes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The ultimate racing tournament beyond time and space awaits!</h2>The gods of our galaxy have opened the gates of their habitats. <br>They are inviting one driver from each planet to show off their racing skills in a sheer limitless world striking with beauty, extreme contrasts, and breathtaking constructions. But there is a lot on the line: the losing planets will be eliminated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Race in a vibrant and ever-evolving world beyond imagination</h2>The tournament features 27 tracks through a world beyond our imagination. <br>It is unlike anything you have ever seen and only inhabited by titans - giant creatures that have been deemed worthy of staying within the realm of the gods. <br>Racing has never been this epic!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A fast-paced racing experience<br></li><li>27 different tracks through the world of the gods<br></li><li>Each world has a unique design and twist on the racing experience<br></li><li>Giant structures, monuments, and monsters are just some of the obstacles that you have to overcome<br></li><li>Different weapons to clear the way and fight against the other racers<br></li><li>A unique art style and the most vibrant and interactive racing world<br></li><li>Many cool upgrades and improvements for your hoverbike</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The most epic race of all time is about to start.</h2>You have been selected as one of the drivers representing Earth. <br>It\u2019s a race of life and death as only the fastest will survive. <br>Do you have what it takes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The ultimate racing tournament beyond time and space awaits!</h2>The gods of our galaxy have opened the gates of their habitats. <br>They are inviting one driver from each planet to show off their racing skills in a sheer limitless world striking with beauty, extreme contrasts, and breathtaking constructions. But there is a lot on the line: the losing planets will be eliminated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Race in a vibrant and ever-evolving world beyond imagination</h2>The tournament features 27 tracks through a world beyond our imagination. <br>It is unlike anything you have ever seen and only inhabited by titans - giant creatures that have been deemed worthy of staying within the realm of the gods. <br>Racing has never been this epic!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A fast-paced racing experience<br></li><li>27 different tracks through the world of the gods<br></li><li>Each world has a unique design and twist on the racing experience<br></li><li>Giant structures, monuments, and monsters are just some of the obstacles that you have to overcome<br></li><li>Different weapons to clear the way and fight against the other racers<br></li><li>A unique art style and the most vibrant and interactive racing world<br></li><li>Many cool upgrades and improvements for your hoverbike</li></ul>",
